const pool=[['被窝引力与逃逸速度','第一宿舍 · 枕头实验室','必修'],['表情包的精神传达','线上教室 · 只发表情','选修'],['奶茶甜度与情绪曲线','食堂二楼 · 加料窗口','实验'],['如何优雅地等下班','摸鱼楼 · 靠窗位置','必修'],['午睡中的意识漫游','图书馆 · 阳光角落','实践'],['截止日期前的奇迹','机房 · 最后一排','必修'],['火锅食材最优下锅序','食堂一楼 · 快乐锅底','实验'],['今天也还不错','操场 · 看云专区','选修'],['互联网抽象表达入门','整活楼 · 404 教室','必修'],['不想卷的自洽艺术','草坪 · 发呆特区','选修']];
let lastSchedule='';function drawSchedule(){let chosen;do{chosen=[...pool].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5).slice(0,3);}while(chosen.map(x=>x[0]).join()===lastSchedule);lastSchedule=chosen.map(x=>x[0]).join();$('#schedule').innerHTML=chosen.map((x,i)=>`<div class="class-row"><span>${['10:30','14:00','16:20'][i]}</span><div><strong>${x[0]}</strong><small>${x[1]}</small></div><b>${x[2]}</b></div>`).join('');}drawSchedule();$('#shuffle').addEventListener('click',drawSchedule);
const foods=[['🍜','一碗热腾腾的牛肉面','汤要热，烦恼要少。'],['🍚','黄焖鸡米饭，加一份快乐','吃饱了才有力气想下一顿。'],['🥟','饺子！蘸醋还是蘸醋？','生活有褶，也可以很好吃。'],['🍲','麻辣烫，蔬菜也要安排上','随心选一点，认真吃一顿。'],['🍱','一份荤素搭配的盖饭','今天的小确幸，是刚刚好的饱。'],['🍝','番茄意面，快乐转个圈','什么事，吃完再说。'],['🍛','咖喱鸡饭，香迷糊了','奶龙批准：今天可以多吃两口。']];let lastFood=-1;$('#food-draw').addEventListener('click',()=>{let n;do{n=Math.floor(Math.random()*foods.length);}while(n===lastFood);lastFood=n;const f=foods[n];$('.food-art').textContent=f[0];$('#food-result').textContent=f[1];$('.food-panel>small').textContent=f[2];$('#food-draw').innerHTML='校长，再想一个 <span>↻</span>';});
let cardName='';const seal=new Image();seal.src='assets/seal.svg';
function renderCard(name,school){const canvas=$('#card'),c=canvas.getContext('2d');c.fillStyle='#f7f4e7';c.fillRect(0,0,1200,800);c.strokeStyle='#c8cfb6';c.lineWidth=2;c.strokeRect(35,35,1130,730);c.strokeRect(44,44,1112,712);c.fillStyle='#173d32';c.fillRect(35,35,1130,16);if(seal.complete&&seal.naturalWidth)c.drawImage(seal,80,85,85,85);c.fillStyle='#173d32';c.font='bold 37px "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif';c.fillText('大连奶龙大学',185,125);c.font='12px Arial';c.fillText('DALIAN MILK DRAGON UNIVERSITY · SPECIAL EDITION',187,151);c.font='13px Arial';c.textAlign='right';c.fillText('A TICKET TO THE HAPPY SIDE',1110,126);c.textAlign='left';c.strokeStyle='#bdc5ad';c.beginPath();c.moveTo(80,195);c.lineTo(1120,195);c.stroke();c.fillStyle='#8b936f';c.font='17px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText('趣 味 入 学 纪 念 卡',80,245);c.fillStyle='#173d32';c.font='bold 40px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText(name+' 同学：',80,322);c.font='23px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText('经本校“看你挺顺眼”委员会一致决定，',80,385);c.fillText('欢迎你加入 '+school.name+'。',80,430);c.fillStyle='#6b785d';c.font='20px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText('愿你有事做，有饭吃，有觉睡，有笑话可以讲。',80,495);c.fillText('学院精神：'+school.motto,80,540);c.font='16px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillStyle='#173d32';c.fillText('校长签名：奶龙（精神上已签字）',80,626);c.fillStyle='#b45843';c.strokeStyle='#b45843';c.save();c.translate(995,587);c.rotate(-.2);c.lineWidth=3;c.beginPath();c.arc(0,0,70,0,Math.PI*2);c.stroke();c.lineWidth=1;c.beginPath();c.arc(0,0,63,0,Math.PI*2);c.stroke();c.textAlign='center';c.font='bold 23px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText('快乐入学',0,-6);c.fillText('精神满分',0,25);c.restore();c.strokeStyle='#c8cfb6';c.beginPath();c.moveTo(80,685);c.lineTo(1120,685);c.stroke();const date=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).format(new Date());c.fillStyle='#818c70';c.font='13px "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif';c.fillText('仅供娱乐纪念 · 非录取凭证 · 不具有学籍或学历效力',80,720);c.textAlign='right';c.fillText(date,1120,720);c.textAlign='left';}
$('#enroll-form').addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const input=$('#nickname');const name=input.value.trim();if(!name){input.setCustomValidity('给自己起个昵称吧，空格不算哦。');input.reportValidity();return;}input.setCustomValidity('');const s=schools.find(s=>s.id===select.value);if(!s)return;if(!seal.complete)await new Promise(resolve=>{seal.onload=resolve;seal.onerror=resolve;});cardName=name;renderCard(name,s);$('#enroll-input').hidden=true;$('#enroll-output').hidden=false;$('#card-caption').textContent=name+' 同学，欢迎加入'+s.name+'！';$('#enroll-dialog').scrollTop=0;$('#download-card').focus();});
$('#nickname').addEventListener('input',()=>$('#nickname').setCustomValidity(''));
$('#download-card').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#card').toBlob(blob=>{if(!blob){toast('图片生成失败，请重新生成一次。');return;}const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob);const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='奶龙大学-'+cardName.replace(/[\\/:*?"<>|]/g,'')+'-入学纪念卡.png';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),3000);toast('快乐已打包，纪念卡开始下载。');},'image/png');});
$('#reset-card').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('#enroll-input').hidden=false;$('#enroll-output').hidden=true;$('#nickname').focus();});
let toastTimer;function toast(msg){$('#toast').textContent=msg;$('#toast').classList.add('visible');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').classList.remove('visible'),3000);}
